WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.910
A raised platform.

2
00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.680
A staring crowd.

3
00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:07.070
One woman, with a red
letter A on her chest.

4
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.390
A bedside, by candlelight.

5
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.960
The same woman, nursing the sick.

6
00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.170
A forest.

7
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:16.010
And the letter lies on
the ground beside her.

8
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.070
Sinner.

9
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.030
Saint.

10
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.060
Rebel.

11
00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.580
Which one is the real Hester Prynne?

12
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:26.550
In this mission, you'll watch her face
the crowd on the scaffold, without hiding.

13
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.730
You'll see how the town's view of
her letter shifts over seven years:

14
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.780
"They said that it meant Able".

15
00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.540
And you'll trace her, chapter by chapter,

16
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:38.640
from the scaffold to
the forest and beyond.

17
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:42.370
Your mission: decide who
Hester Prynne really is.
